<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?> <?xml-stylesheet type="text/xsl" href="rss.xsl"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"> <channel> <title>SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</title><description>SONiC NOS（sonic-net/SONiC）の日本語非公式ドキュメント</description><link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link><atom:link href="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /> <docs>https://github.com/aoki-taquan/sonic-unofficial-docs</docs><language>ja</language> <pubDate>Fri, 29 May 2026 03:25:22 -0000</pubDate> <lastBuildDate>Fri, 29 May 2026 03:25:22 -0000</lastBuildDate> <ttl>1440</ttl> <generator>MkDocs RSS plugin - v1.19.0</generator> <image> <url>None</url> <title>SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</title> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link> </image> <item> <title>SAG テーブル</title> <description>SAG テーブル — Static Anycast Gateway (SAG) のグローバル仮想 MAC アドレスを保持する CONFIG_DB テーブル。EVPN/VXLAN ファブリック内で全 leaf switch が同一ゲートウェイ IP/MAC を共有するために使用する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/sag/</link> <pubDate>Fri, 29 May 2026 03:23:18 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/sag/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/sag.png" type="image/png" length="33403" /> </item> <item> <title>CONFIG_DB save / load が反映されない</title> <description>Runbook: CONFIG_DB save / load が反映されない — : sonic-net/sonic-utilities @ 39732bceb — config/main.py, scripts/db_migrator.py</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/config-save-load/</link> <pubDate>Fri, 29 May 2026 03:23:18 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/config-save-load/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/runbooks/config-save-load.png" type="image/png" length="48058" /> </item> <item> <title>thermalctld の speed_tolerance API 廃止と移行</title> <description>thermalctld が speed_tolerance を STATE_DB に書き込まなくなった変更と、Fan クラスの is_under_speed / is_over_speed API への移行方法。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/platform/thermalctld-speed-tolerance-api-change/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 01:24:01 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/platform/thermalctld-speed-tolerance-api-change/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/platform/thermalctld-speed-tolerance-api-change.png" type="image/png" length="46054" /> </item> <item> <title>ACL_RULE テーブル</title> <description>ACL_RULE テーブル — ACL_TABLE 内の個別ルールを定義する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/acl-rule/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 01:14:58 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/acl-rule/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/acl-rule.png" type="image/png" length="20016" /> </item> <item> <title>ACL_TABLE_TYPE テーブル</title> <description>ACL_TABLE_TYPE テーブル — ユーザ定義 ACL テーブルタイプ（カスタム match フィールド / action / バインドポイント）を定義する CONFIG_DB テーブル。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/acl-table-type/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 01:14:58 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/acl-table-type/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/acl-table-type.png" type="image/png" length="28072" /> </item> <item> <title>ACL_TABLE テーブル</title> <description>ACL_TABLE テーブル — ACL コンテナ（適用ポイント / 種別 / 段 (ingress/egress)）を定義する CONFIG_DB テーブル。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/acl-table/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 01:14:58 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/acl-table/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/acl-table.png" type="image/png" length="25716" /> </item> <item> <title>ACL orchagent STATE_DB テーブル</title> <description>STATE_DB の ACL 関連テーブル — AclOrch が SAI ACL 操作後に書き込む ACL_TABLE_TABLE / ACL_RULE_TABLE / ACL_STAGE_CAPABILITY_TABLE の構造とフィールド詳細。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/aclorch-state/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 01:14:58 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/aclorch-state/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/aclorch-state.png" type="image/png" length="41089" /> </item> <item> <title>アプリケーション フローカウンタ設定</title> <description>CONFIG_DB FLOW_COUNTER_ROUTE_PATTERN / FLEX_COUNTER_TABLE FLOW_CNT_TRAP|FLOW_CNT_ROUTE — route flow counter と trap flow counter の有効化・パターン設定・ポーリング間隔のコード由来デフォルト解説。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/app-counter/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 01:14:58 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/app-counter/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/app-counter.png" type="image/png" length="27039" /> </item> <item> <title>APPL_DB ACL テーブル群</title> <description>APPL_DB の ACL_TABLE_TABLE / ACL_TABLE_TYPE_TABLE / ACL_RULE_TABLE — vnetorch・mclagsyncd・dashenifwdorch が直接書き込む APPL_DB 側 ACL エントリの構造・フィールドデフォルト・コード挙動。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/appl-acl/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 01:14:58 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/appl-acl/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/appl-acl.png" type="image/png" length="31058" /> </item> <item> <title>APPL_DB BUFFER_* テーブル群</title> <description>APPL_DB の BUFFER_POOL_TABLE / BUFFER_PROFILE_TABLE / BUFFER_PG_TABLE / BUFFER_QUEUE_TABLE / BUFFER_PORT_*_PROFILE_LIST_TABLE — buffermgrd が CONFIG_DB から変換して書き込み、bufferorch が SAI へ反映するバッファ関連テーブル群。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/appl-buffer/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 01:14:58 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/appl-buffer/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/appl-buffer.png" type="image/png" length="29946" /> </item> <item> <title>APPL_DB FDB_TABLE</title> <description>APPL_DB FDB_TABLE — 動的学習および静的プロビジョニング MAC アドレスエントリを保持する APPL_DB テーブル。Vlan&lt;id&gt;:&lt;MAC&gt; をキーに port・type・discard フィールドを持ち、FdbOrch が SAI FDB エントリへ変換する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/appl-fdb/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 01:14:58 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/appl-fdb/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/appl-fdb.png" type="image/png" length="32924" /> </item> <item> <title>APPL_DB MCLAG/ICCP 関連テーブル</title> <description>APPL_DB MCLAG/ICCP 関連テーブル — mclagsyncd が iccpd からの IPC メッセージを受けて APPL_DB に書き込む MCLAG_FDB_TABLE・ISOLATION_GROUP_TABLE・ACL_TABLE_TABLE・ACL_RULE_TABLE・LAG_TABLE・PORT_TABLE・INTF_TABLE の各フィールドとコード由来デフォルト。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/appl-mclag/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 01:14:58 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/appl-mclag/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/appl-mclag.png" type="image/png" length="35509" /> </item> <item> <title>APPL_DB FIXED_MIRROR_SESSION_TABLE (P4RT)</title> <description>APPL_DB FIXED_MIRROR_SESSION_TABLE — P4RT ランタイムが書き込む ERSPAN ミラーセッション定義テーブル。MirrorSessionManager が APPL_DB を購読し SAI MIRROR_SESSION オブジェクトに変換する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/appl-mirror/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 01:14:58 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/appl-mirror/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/appl-mirror.png" type="image/png" length="44398" /> </item> <item> <title>APPL_DB PORT_TABLE</title> <description>APPL_DB PORT_TABLE — 物理ポートの実効設定と運用状態を保持する APPL_DB テーブル。portsyncd が CONFIG_DB PORT テーブルをそのまま転写し、portmgrd がデフォルト値を補完し、orchagent が SAI 状態変化を書き戻す。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/appl-port-table/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 01:14:58 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/appl-port-table/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/appl-port-table.png" type="image/png" length="36817" /> </item> <item> <title>APPL_DB VLAN_TABLE / VLAN_MEMBER_TABLE テーブル</title> <description>APPL_DB VLAN_TABLE / VLAN_MEMBER_TABLE テーブル — vlanmgrd が CONFIG_DB VLAN/VLAN_MEMBER を変換して書き込む中間テーブル。orchagent (portsorch) が購読して SAI VLAN/VLAN_MEMBER を生成する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/appl-vlan/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 01:14:58 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/appl-vlan/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/appl-vlan.png" type="image/png" length="38125" /> </item> <item> <title>APPL_DB VRF_TABLE テーブル</title> <description>APPL_DB VRF_TABLE テーブル — vrfmgrd が CONFIG_DB VRF を変換して書き込む。VRFOrch が購読し SAI Virtual Router を生成する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/appl-vrf/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 01:14:58 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/appl-vrf/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/appl-vrf.png" type="image/png" length="35272" /> </item> <item> <title>AS_PATH_SET テーブル</title> <description>AS_PATH_SET テーブル — BGP の AS path access-list を CONFIG_DB に持たせるテーブル。sonic-routing-policy-sets.yang の AS_PATH_SET コンテナで定義され、ROUTE_MAP の match as-path 等から参照される。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/as-path-set/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 01:14:58 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/as-path-set/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/as-path-set.png" type="image/png" length="31547" /> </item> <item> <title>BGP_GLOBALS_AF テーブル</title> <description>BGP_GLOBALS_AF テーブル — BGP_GLOBALS_AF は BGP_GLOBALS の VRF ごとに、address-family / subsequent address-family 単位の BGP 設定を保持する CONFIG_DB テーブル。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/bgp-globals-af/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 01:14:58 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/bgp-globals-af/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/bgp-globals-af.png" type="image/png" length="33554" /> </item> <item> <title>BGP_GLOBALS テーブル</title> <description>BGP_GLOBALS テーブル — VRF 単位の BGP 全体パラメータ（router-id、local AS、graceful restart、route reflector、bestpath 比較ルール、confederation、keepalive/holdtime、max-med、max delay 等）…</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/bgp-globals/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 01:14:58 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/bgp-globals/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/bgp-globals.png" type="image/png" length="34304" /> </item> <item> <title>BGP_INTERNAL_NEIGHBOR テーブル</title> <description>BGP_INTERNAL_NEIGHBOR テーブル — マルチ ASIC プラットフォームにおける ASIC 間内部 iBGP セッションを CONFIG_DB で定義するテーブル。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/bgp-internal-neighbor/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 01:14:58 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/bgp-internal-neighbor/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/bgp-internal-neighbor.png" type="image/png" length="29163" /> </item> </channel> </rss>